# Thinkway Continuity Pack

Before substantive work, read:

| Doc | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Prompt** | `.cursor/continuity/PROMPT.md` | Permanent working principles & methodology |
| **Summary** | `.cursor/continuity/SUMMARY.md` | Permanent Thinkway Platform knowledge base |
| **Prompt Summary** | `.cursor/continuity/PROMPT_SUMMARY.md` | Concise current conversation / sprint state |

## Maintenance

Update these **naturally** when the project evolves (new envs, architecture decisions, sprint outcomes, blockers). Keep each file concise, accurate, and useful for cross-session continuity.

- **Prompt** — principles/methodology only (rarely changes).
- **Summary** — durable platform facts (stack, hierarchy, envs, SSOT docs).
- **Prompt Summary** — replace/refresh each sprint or major conversation arc; drop stale blockers when resolved.

Do not duplicate full product specs here — link to `docs/THINKWAY_SYSTEM_REFERENCE.md` and related docs instead.
